# Allow only the inputs used by ChatServer/Dockerfile.
# Client, tests, documentation, scripts, Git metadata and unrelated labs
# are excluded from the Docker context by default.
**
!ChatServer/
!ChatServer/**
!Shared/
!Shared/**

# Exclusions below also apply inside the allowed directories.
**/*.[mM][dD]
**/docs
**/bin
**/obj
**/out
**/.vs
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/uploads
**/.lab2-tests
**/appsettings.json
**/appsettings.*.json
!ChatServer/appsettings.example.json
**/*.user
**/*.pfx
**/*.key
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/Properties/launchSettings.json
**/Properties/PublishProfiles
